					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr" data-mw-parsoid-version="0.25.0.0-alpha1" data-mw-html-version="2.8.0"><section data-mw-section-id="0" id="mwAQ"><div class="shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux" style="display:none" about="#mwt1" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Short description","href":"./Template:Short_description"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Chinese multinational technology company"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese multinational technology company</div><span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt1"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_with_short_description"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata"/></span>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt2" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Infobox company\n","href":"./Template:Infobox_company"},"params":{"name":{"wt":"Xunlei Limited"},"logo":{"wt":"Xunlei Limited logo.jpg"},"type":{"wt":"[[Public company]]"},"traded_as":{"wt":"{{unbulleted list|{{NASDAQ|XNET}}}}"},"hq_location_city":{"wt":"[[Shenzhen]]"},"hq_location_country":{"wt":"[[China]]"},"area_served":{"wt":"Worldwide"},"industry":{"wt":"[[Internet]], [[multimedia]]"},"num_employees":{"wt":"1513&lt;ref>{{cite web|title=XUNLEI LTD (XNET) IPO|url=http://www.nasdaq.com/markets/ipos/company/xunlei-ltd-857196-75531|website=nasdaq.com}}&lt;/ref>"},"num_employees_year":{"wt":"2014"},"founded":{"wt":"{{Start date and age|2003}}"},"founder":{"wt":"Sean Shenglong Zou"}},"i":0}}]}'><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1385617415" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt3" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>@media(min-width:640px){.mw-parser-output .infobox{margin-left:1em;float:right;clear:right;width:22em}}.mw-parser-output .infobox-subbox{padding:0;border:none;margin:-3px;width:auto;min-width:100%;font-size:100%;clear:none;float:none;background-color:transparent;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .infobox-3cols-child{margin:-3px}.mw-parser-output .infobox .navbar{font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .infobox-hiddenrow,body.skin--responsive.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox .infobox-hiddenrow{display:none}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:var(--color-base)}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .infobox-full-data:not(.notheme)>div:not(.notheme)[style]{background:#1f1f23!important;color:var(--color-base)}}@media(min-width:640px){body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1326365004" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Infobox company/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .ib-company .infobox-label{padding-right:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .ib-company-logo img{background-color:#f8f9fa;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .ib-company-logo .logo-nobg img{background-color:inherit;color:inherit}.mw-parser-output .ib-company-locality,.mw-parser-output .ib-company-country{display:inline}</style></span><table class="infobox ib-company vcard" about="#mwt2" id="mwBA"><tbody><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-above fn org">Xunlei Limited</th></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-image ib-company-logo logo"><span class="mw-default-size logo-nobg" typeof="mw:File/Frameless"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Xunlei_Limited_logo.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Xunlei_Limited_logo.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/2/22/Xunlei_Limited_logo.jpg/250px-Xunlei_Limited_logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/22/Xunlei_Limited_logo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x" data-file-width="284" data-file-height="128" data-file-type="bitmap" height="113" width="250" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 1"/></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Type</th><td class="infobox-data category"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_company" title="Public company">Public company</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; "><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ticker_symbol" title="Ticker symbol">Traded as</a></div></th><td class="infobox-data"><style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r1126788409" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" about="#mwt5" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Plainlist/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'>.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class="plainlist"><ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasdaq" title="Nasdaq">Nasdaq</a>:<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.nasdaq.com/market-activity/stocks/xnet" class="external text">XNET</a></li></ul></div></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Industry</th><td class="infobox-data category"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internet" title="Internet">Internet</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multimedia" title="Multimedia">multimedia</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Founded</th><td class="infobox-data">2003<span class="noprint"><span typeof="mw:Entity">;</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>23<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>years ago</span><span style="display:none"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>(<span class="bday dtstart published updated">2003</span>)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Founder</th><td class="infobox-data agent">Sean Shenglong Zou</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Headquarters</th><td class="infobox-data adr"><div class="ib-company-locality locality"> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shenzhen" title="Shenzhen">Shenzhen</a></div>, <div class="ib-company-country country-name"> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/China" title="China">China</a></div><span style="display:none" data-plural="1"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Area served</div></th><td class="infobox-data">Worldwide</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Number of employees</div></th><td class="infobox-data">1513<sup about="#mwt8" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwBQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCA">]</span></span></a></sup><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>(2014)</td></tr></tbody></table>
<span class="mw-empty-elt" about="#mwt11" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Infobox Chinese","href":"./Template:Infobox_Chinese"},"params":{"title":{"wt":"Xunlei Limited&lt;!--Source: https://ir.xunlei.com/corporate-profile-->"},"order":{"wt":"st"},"s":{"wt":"深圳市迅雷网络技术有限公司&lt;!--Source: https://www.xunlei.com/v2018/dist/aboutusdetail.html-->"},"t":{"wt":"深圳市迅雷網絡技術有限公司"},"p":{"wt":"Shēnzhènshì Xùnléi Wǎngluòjìshù Yǒuxiàngōngsī"},"j":{"wt":"sam1 zan3 si5 seon3 leoi4 mong5 lok3 gei6 seot6 jau5 haan6 gung1 si1"},"l":{"wt":"Shenzhen Xunlei Networking Technologies, Co., Ltd."}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1385617415" about="#mwt12" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></span><table class="infobox" about="#mwt11" id="mwCg"><tbody><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-above" style="color: var(--color-base,#202122);background-color: var(--background-color-interactive-subtle,#b0c4de);">Xunlei Limited</th></tr><tr style="display:none;"><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1385617415" about="#mwt13" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1385617415" about="#mwt14" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="font-weight:normal;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters">Simplified<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Chinese</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Hans" style="font-size: 1rem;">深圳市迅雷网络技术有限公司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="font-weight:normal;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traditional_Chinese_characters" title="Traditional Chinese characters">Traditional<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Chinese</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><span title="Chinese-language text"><span lang="zh-Hant" style="font-size: 1rem;">深圳市迅雷網絡技術有限公司</span></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Chinese-language_text"/></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="font-weight:normal;">Literal meaning</th><td class="infobox-data">Shenzhen Xunlei Networking Technologies, Co., Ltd.</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" class="infobox-full-data"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1385617415" about="#mwt15" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Infobox/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><table class="infobox-subbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="display:inline-table; text-align: left;"><tbody><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-above" style="font-size: 100%; text-align: left;color: #202122; background-color: #f9ffbc;">Transcriptions</th></tr><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-header" style="color: #202122;background-color: #dcffc9;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_Chinese" title="Standard Chinese">Standard Mandarin</a></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="font-weight:normal;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanyu_Pinyin" title="Hanyu Pinyin" class="mw-redirect">Hanyu Pinyin</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><span title="Chinese-language romanization"><span style="font-style: normal" lang="zh-Latn">Shēnzhènshì Xùnléi Wǎngluòjìshù Yǒuxiàngōngsī</span></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="2" class="infobox-header" style="color: #202122;background-color: #dcffc9;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cantonese" title="Cantonese">Yue: Cantonese</a></th></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label" style="font-weight:normal;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jyutping" title="Jyutping">Jyutping</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><span title="Yue Chinese-language romanization"><span style="font-style: normal" lang="yue-Latn">sam1 zan3 si5 seon3 leoi4 mong5 lok3 gei6 seot6 jau5 haan6 gung1 si1</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></td><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1385617415"/></tr><tr style="display:none"><td colspan="2">
</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p id="mwCw"><b id="mwDA">Xunlei Limited</b> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt17" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwDQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"迅雷"},"p":{"wt":"Xùnléi"},"j":{"wt":"seon3 leoi4"},"l":{"wt":"thunderbolt"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt17">:</span><span about="#mwt17"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt17"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>迅雷</span><span about="#mwt17">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin" title="Pinyin" about="#mwt17">pinyin</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt17">:</span><span about="#mwt17"> </span><i about="#mwt17"><span lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">Xùnléi</span></i><span about="#mwt17">; </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jyutping" title="Jyutping" about="#mwt17">Jyutping</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt17">:</span><span about="#mwt17"> </span><i about="#mwt17"><span lang="yue-Latn-jyutping">seon3 leoi4</span></i><span about="#mwt17">; </span><abbr title="Literal translation" about="#mwt17"><small>lit.</small></abbr><span about="#mwt17"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt17">'</span><span about="#mwt17">thunderbolt</span><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt17">'</span>) is a Chinese multinational technology company and an <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_service_provider" title="Online service provider" id="mwDg">online service provider</a> founded in 2003. The subsidiary of Xunlei Limited, <b id="mwDw">Shenzhen Xunlei Networking Technologies, Co., Ltd.</b> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simplified_Chinese_characters" title="Simplified Chinese characters" about="#mwt18" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"zh","href":"./Template:Zh"},"params":{"s":{"wt":"迅雷网络技术有限公司"}},"i":0}}]}'>Chinese</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" about="#mwt18">:</span><span about="#mwt18"> </span><span lang="zh-Hans" about="#mwt18" id="mwEQ"><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_simplified_Chinese-language_text"/>迅雷网络技术有限公司</span>) was formerly known as <b id="mwEg">Sandai Technologies (Shenzhen) Inc.</b> and changed its name to <b id="mwEw">Shenzhen Xunlei Networking Technologies, Co., Ltd.</b> in May 2005.<sup about="#mwt19" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwFA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFg">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFw">]</span></span></a></sup> Its headquarters are in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nanshan_District,_Shenzhen" title="Nanshan District, Shenzhen" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGA">Nanshan District, Shenzhen</a>.<sup about="#mwt22" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-3" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-3" id="mwGQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwHA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwHQ">In April 2014, Xunlei received an investment from a Chinese electronics company <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiaomi" title="Xiaomi" id="mwHg">Xiaomi</a> of $200 million.<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-4" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-4" id="mwHw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIQ">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">]</span></span></a></sup> On 24 June 2014, it went public on the Nasdaq Stock Exchange, selling 7.315 million American depositary shares (ADS) at $12 and raising just shy of $88 million.<sup about="#mwt28" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwIw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJQ">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">]</span></span></a></sup> According to the annual ranking of China's top 100 internet companies released by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_Industry_and_Information_Technology" title="Ministry of Industry and Information Technology" id="mwJw">Ministry of Industry and Information Technology</a> of the Chinese government, Xunlei occupied 42nd place in 2017's ranking.<sup about="#mwt31" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwKA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKg">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwKw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwLA">The main products developed by Xunlei Limited is the Xunlei <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Download_manager" title="Download manager" id="mwLQ">download manager</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peer-to-peer" title="Peer-to-peer" id="mwLg">Peer-to-peer</a> software, supporting <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTTP" title="HTTP" id="mwLw">HTTP</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FTP" title="FTP" class="mw-redirect" id="mwMA">FTP</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EDonkey_network" title="EDonkey network" id="mwMQ">eDonkey</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BitTorrent" title="BitTorrent" id="mwMg">BitTorrent</a> protocols. <span about="#mwt32" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwMw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"As of","href":"./Template:As_of"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"2010"}},"i":0}}]}'>As of 2010</span><sup class="plainlinks noexcerpt noprint asof-tag update" style="display:none;" about="#mwt32"><a rel="mw:ExtLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Xunlei&amp;action=edit" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Xunlei&amp;action=edit"><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span>update<span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></a></sup><span typeof="mw:Nowiki" about="#mwt32"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements_from_2010" about="#mwt32"/><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:All_articles_containing_potentially_dated_statements" about="#mwt32" id="mwNA"/>, it was the most commonly used BitTorrent client in the world.<sup about="#mwt35" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mwNQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwNg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNw">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwOA">]</span></span></a></sup> In October 2017, the company announced that it will transform itself into a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blockchain" title="Blockchain" id="mwOQ">blockchain</a> company, and release a blockchain-based product named OneThing Cloud. OneThing Cloud users get LinkToken (a type of virtual token) for contributing their bandwidth to the Xunlei's <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_delivery_network" title="Content delivery network" id="mwOg">content delivery network</a>.<sup about="#mwt38" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-8" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-8" id="mwOw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPQ">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwPg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwPw">Xunlei Ltd. announced that its board of directors has appointed Lei Chen, who is a former <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tencent" title="Tencent" id="mwQA">Tencent</a> cloud computing unit leader,<sup about="#mwt41" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-9" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-9" id="mwQQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwQg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQw">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRA">]</span></span></a></sup> as its chief executive officer of the company and director of the board on 29 June 2017. On 12 December 2017,<sup about="#mwt44" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwRQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRw">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwSA">]</span></span></a></sup> Xunlei announced that the board of directors of the company has elected Mr. Chuan Wang as the chairman of board of directors of the company. Wang has been a director of Xunlei since March 2014. Wang is a co-founder of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xiaomi" title="Xiaomi" id="mwSQ">Xiaomi Inc.</a>, where he has served as its vice president since 2012. He is also the founder of Beijing Duokan Technology Co., Ltd., where he has served as its chief executive officer since its inception of business in 2010.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwSg" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwSw" aria-labelledby="Products"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Products">Products</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Xunlei&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Products"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
